  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Risk Insurance (DRI) - Consultancies cost for Global Parametrics - FRP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancies costs for specialist advice relating to the sale of Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) investment in Global Parametrics, which was established to provide risk finance products in order to protect developing country private sector and non-state entities against disaster risk. Sale processes intended to put Global Parametrics on a strong future footing to ensure it will continue delivering development impact for disaster vulnerable communities in ODA-eligible countries.</narrative>
  </description>
